# Class: obo:SWO_0000145 (Segway 1.2)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_0000145 "The free Segway software package contains a novel method for analyzing multiple tracks of functional genomics data. Our method uses a dynamic Bayesian network (DBN) model, which enables it to analyze the entire genome at 1-bp resolution even in the face of heterogeneous patterns of missing data. This method is the first application of DBN techniques to genome-scale data and the first genomic segmentation method designed for use with the maximum resolution data available from ChIP-seq experiments without downsampling.")
SubClassOf(obo:SWO_0000145 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:SWO_0000086 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:IAO_0000027 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:SWO_0004002 obo:SWO_3000071))))
SubClassOf(obo:SWO_0000145 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:SWO_0000087 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:IAO_0000027 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:SWO_0004002 <http://edamontology.org/format_3003>))))
