# Class: obo:SWO_0000158 (libSBML)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_0000158 "LibSBML is a free, open-source programming library to help you read, write, manipulate, translate, and validate SBML files and data streams. It provides interfaces for C, C++, C#(.NET), Java, MATLAB, Octave, Perl, Python R and Ruby. LibSBML is available for free under LGPL terms in both source-code form and precompiled binaries for Windows, Mac OS X, and Linux.")
SubClassOf(obo:SWO_0000158 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:SWO_0000086 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:IAO_0000027 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:SWO_0004002 <http://edamontology.org/format_2585>))))
