# Class: obo:SWO_1000104 (NIDA NIH Data Access Policy)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_1000104 "The NIDA NIH Data Access Policy specifies under what legal requirements NIDA NIH data may be accessed. Researchers may gain access to clinical data, genetic analysis data, and DNA by obtaining formal approval from the NIDA Genetic Data Access Request Committee. ")
