# Class: obo:SWO_1000121 (NIH Genomic Data Sharing Policy)

AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_1000121 "The NIH Genomic Data Sharing Policy specifies under what legal requirements NIH genomic data may be accessed. Access to human data is through a tiered model involving unrestricted- and controlled-data
access mechanisms. Requests for controlled-access data are reviewed by NIH Data Access Committees (DACs).")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000119 obo:SWO_1000121 "https://gds.nih.gov/PDF/NIH_GDS_Policy.pdf")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:creator obo:SWO_1000121 "Allyson Lister")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:SWO_1000121 "NIH Genomic Data Sharing Policy"@en)
