AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_1000132 "The UCUM Terms of Use is a vendor-specific license which allows the resource it references to be used for commercial or non-commercial purposes without restriction of any kind, provided that appropriate attribution is given. However, the resource itself may not be modified in any way. Users may make and distribute an unlimited number of copies of the Licensed Materials. Each copy thereof must include the Copyright Notice and License.")
