AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_1100036 "BRB-ArrayTools is an integrated package for the visualization and statistical analysis of DNA microarray gene expression data. It was developed by professional statisticians experienced in the analysis of microarray data and involved in the development of improved methods for the design and analysis of microarray based experiments. The system incorporates a variety of powerful analytic and visualization tools developed specifically for microarray data analysis.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:SWO_1100036 "BRB-ArrayTools")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_1100038 "BZScan is a free java tool for automatic quantification of DNA microarrays with radioactive labeling. BZScan provides saturation, overshining, and background noise correction, it also gives quality control measures. It can work either in a fully automatic \"batch mode\" or at different levels of manual operation.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:SWO_1100038 "BZScan")
