AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:SWO_1100136 "AnalyzerPro")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(obo:IAO_0000119 "https://sciex.com/technology/swath-acquisition") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_1100137 "SWATH is the only data independent acquisition (DIA) technique that allows comprehensive detection and quantitation of virtually every detectable compound in a sample (MS/MSALL). This provides confidence in your quantitative results and virtually eliminates the risk of missing a critical component. SWATH Acquisition strategy can only be achieved through the power and speed of SCIEX TripleTOF® and QTOF technology.")
AnnotationAssertion(obo:IAO_0000117 obo:SWO_1100137 "Allyson Lister")
AnnotationAssertion(dc:contributor obo:SWO_1100137 "Allyson Lister")
