AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(obo:IAO_0000119 "https://htseq.readthedocs.io/en/release_0.11.1/overview.html") Annotation(rdf:type owl:Axiom) obo:IAO_0000115 obo:SWO_1100140 "HTSeq is a Python package that provides infrastructure to process data from high-throughput sequencing assays.")
